  "title": "Fuel spill during refuelling, fire service attends",
  "narrative": "Alicante, early evening. During refuelling of NW-ALF (A321) for NWD631 to Manchester at 17:45 with 220 passengers, fuel overflows from the left wing vent and about 200 litres spill onto the stand. The airport fire service attends and closes the stand; boarding had not started. The aircraft must be inspected before flight. The contracted engineer in Alicante is available; there is no spare in Alicante.",
